cated. Please use tls.TLSSocket instead.\\n\\nDEP0044: util.isArray()\\n#\\nHistory\\n\\nType: Runtime\\n\\nThe util.isArray() API is deprecated. Please use Array.isArray() instead.\\n\\nAn automated migration is available (source):\\n\\nnpx codemod@latest @nodejs/util-is \\nCOPY\\nDEP0045: util.isBoolean()\\n#\\nHis\n\n[... tool result middle pruned ...]\n\nilable (source):\\n\\nnpx codemod@latest @nodejs/util-log-to-console-log \\nCOPY\\nDEP0060: util._extend()\\n#\\nHistory\\n\\nType: Runtime\\n\\nThe util._extend() API is deprecated because it's an unmaintained legacy API that was exposed to user land by accident. Please use target = Object.assign(target, source) instead.\\n\\nAn automated migration is available (source):\\n\\nnpx codemod@latest @nodejs/util-extend-to-object-assign \\nCOPY\\nDEP0061: fs.SyncWriteStream\\n#\\nHistory\\n\\nType: End-of-Life\\n\\nThe fs.SyncWriteStream class was never intended to be a publicly accessible API and has been removed. No alternat\",\"links\":[],\"segmentIndex\":1,\"segmentCount\":8,\"truncated\":true,\"captureTruncated\":false,\"httpStatus\":200,\"sourcePath\":\"C:\\\\Temp\\\\weftmate-fact1-c58d89dc-3e76-46e3-9040-cca76323b11f\\\\profile\\\\conversations\\\\00a4d8622178734183c89533a75e2db0857ed901521f6825d948785c8f6f0e81\\\\session-1f2ebded-8e48-4abd-8b3a-cb82be553a40\\\\.weftmate-web-sources\\\\capture-ef4f9493-aba8-4954-8be7-857c979a0e3f.txt\",\"previewTruncated\":false}"
