DEP0004: CryptoStream.prototype.readyState\\n#\\nHistory\\n\\n[characters 2324-2341]\\nType: End-of-Life\\n\\n[characters 2343-2402]\\nThe CryptoStream.prototype.readyState property was removed.\\n\\n[characters 2445-2491]\\nType: Application (non-node_modules code only)\\n\\n[characters 3226-3497]\\nWithout --pending-deprecation, runtime warnings occur only for code not in node_modules. This means there will not be deprecation warnings for Buffer() usage in dependencies. With --pending-deprecation, a runtime warning results no matter where the Buffer() usage occurs.\\n\\n[characters 3551-3568]\\nType: End-of-Life\\n\\n[characters 3820-3837]\\nType: End-of-Life\\n\\n[characters 4325-4349]\\nType: Documentation-only\\n\\n[characters 4690-4707]\\nType: End-of-Life\\n\\n[characters 4709-5044]\\nUse of the crypto.pbkdf2() API without specifying a digest was deprecated in Node.js 6.0 because the method defaulted to using the non-recommended 'SHA1' digest. Previously, a deprecation warning was printed. Starting in Node.js 8.0.0, calling crypto.pbkdf2() or crypto.pbkdf2Sync() with digest set to undefined will throw a TypeError.\\n\\n[characters 5211-5281]\\nNow, however, passing either undefined or null will throw a TypeError.\\n\\n[characters 5328-5345]\\nType: End-of-Life\\n\\n[characters 5481-5498]\\nType: End-of-Life\\n\\n[characters 5616-5633]\\nType: End-of-Life\\n\\n[characters 5828-5845]\\nType: End-of-Life\\n\\n[characters 5847-5991]\\nCalling an asynchronous function without a callback throws a TypeError in Node.js 10.0.0 onwards. See https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/12562.\\n\\n[characters 6045-6062]\\nType: End-of-Life\\n\\n[characters 6236-6253]\\nType: End-of-Life\\n\\n[characters 6407-6424]\\nType: End-of-Life\\n\\n[characters 6582-6599]\\nType: End-of-Life\\n\\n[characters 6743-6760]\\nType: End-of-Life\\n\\n[characters 7084-7101]\\nType: End-of-Life\\n\\n[characters 7251-7268]\\nType: End-of-Life\\n\\n[characters 7448-7465]\\nType: End-of-Life\\n\\n[characters 7607-7624]\\nType: End-of-Life\\n\\n[characters 7882-7899]\\nType: End-of-Life\\n\\n[characters 8008-8066]\\nDEP0024: REPLServer.prototype.convertToContext()\\n#\\nHistory\\n\\n[characters 8068-8085]\\nType: End-of-Life\\n\\n[characters 8087-8152]\\\n\n[... tool result middle pruned ...]\n\n7,\"text\":\"Type: End-of-Life\"},{\"charStart\":13669,\"charEnd\":13686,\"text\":\"Type: End-of-Life\"},{\"charStart\":13688,\"charEnd\":13773,\"text\":\"The util.isNumber() API has been removed. Please use typeof arg === 'number' instead.\"},{\"charStart\":13899,\"charEnd\":13916,\"text\":\"Type: End-of-Life\"},{\"charStart\":13918,\"charEnd\":14010,\"text\":\"The util.isObject() API has been removed. Please use arg && typeof arg === 'object' instead.\"},{\"charStart\":14139,\"charEnd\":14156,\"text\":\"Type: End-of-Life\"},{\"charStart\":14368,\"charEnd\":14385,\"text\":\"Type: End-of-Life\"},{\"charStart\":14596,\"charEnd\":14613,\"text\":\"Type: End-of-Life\"},{\"charStart\":14615,\"charEnd\":14692,\"text\":\"The util.isString() API has been removed. Please use typeof arg === 'string' \"}],\"sourcePath\":\"C:\\\\Temp\\\\weftmate-fact1-c58d89dc-3e76-46e3-9040-cca76323b11f\\\\profile\\\\conversations\\\\00a4d8622178734183c89533a75e2db0857ed901521f6825d948785c8f6f0e81\\\\session-1f2ebded-8e48-4abd-8b3a-cb82be553a40\\\\.weftmate-web-sources\\\\capture-ef4f9493-aba8-4954-8be7-857c979a0e3f.txt\"}"
