  "arguments": "{\"description\":\"核对 Node 24/22 草稿断言\",\"prompt\":\"Do not browse, write files or delegate. List each draft claim → source number + exact phrase → meaning/scope/numbers verdict. Challenge unsupported inferences even if the writer said they were verified. Runtime build rules do not prove addon build rules; a commit title can be intermediate/reverted; Node-API is an exception to ordinary module ABI mismatch. Return concise corrections or 未在官方资料中确认, not a rewritten article.\\n\\nSources:\\n[1] Node.js 24.0.0 release notes, https://nodejs.org/en/blog/release/v24.0.0, capturedAt 2026-10-10T03:20:12.828Z. Exact phrases: \\\"Starting with Node.js 24, support for MSVC has been removed, and ClangCL is now required to compile Node.js on Windows.\\\" ; \\\"This release brings several significant updates, including the upgrade of the V8 JavaScript engine to version 13.6 and npm to version 11.\\\" ; release commit list phrase: \\\"[f26cab1b85] - (SEMVER-MAJOR) src: update NODE_MODULE_VERSION to 137 (Michaël Zasso) #58070\\\"\\n[2] Node.js 22.0.0 release notes, https://nodejs.org/en/blog/release/v22.0.0, capturedAt 2026-10-10T03:20:13.718Z. Exact phrases: \\\"We're excited to announce the release of Node.js 22! Highlights include require()ing ESM graphs, WebSocket client, updates of the V8 JavaScript engine, and more!\\\" ; release commit list phrases: \\\"[2b1e7c2fcb] - (SEMVER-MAJOR) build: compile with C++20 support on Windows (StefanStojanovic) #52465\\\" ; \\\"[582ff5037c] - (SEMVER-MAJOR) src: update NODE_MODULE_VERSION to 127 (Michaël Zasso) #52465\\\"\\n[3] Node-API docs, https://nodejs.org/api/n-api.html#implications-of-abi-stability (fetched as https://nodejs.org/api/n-api.html), capturedAt 2026-10-10T03:20:26.140Z. Exact phrases: \\\"It is intended to insulate addons from changes in the underlying JavaScript engine and allow modules compiled for one major version to run on later major versions of Node.js without recompilation.\\\" ; \\\"Although Node-API provides an ABI stability guarantee, other parts of Node.js do not, and any external libraries used from the addon may not.\\\" ; \\\"none of the following APIs provide an ABI stability guarantee across major versions: the Node.js C++ APIs ... the libuv APIs ... the V8 API\\\" ; \\\"Thus, for an addon to remain ABI-compatible across Node.js major versions, it must use Node-API exclusively by restricting itself to using #include <node_api.h>\\\"\\n\\nProposed draft claims (Chinese document, short):\\nA. 标题/引言：本文比较 Node.js 24.0.0（2025-05-06）与 22.0.0（2024-04-24）两份初始发布说明，聚焦 Windows 工具链、原生扩展兼容和 NODE_MODULE_VERSION。\\nB. Windows 工具链：Node.js 24 移除了 MSVC 支持，在 Windows 上编译 Node.js 现在要求 ClangCL；这改变的是编译 Node.js 本身的工具链要求。\\nC. NODE_MODULE_VERSION：24.0.0 发布说明的 semver-major 提交中列有 NODE_MODULE_VERSION 更新到 137，22.0.0 发布说明中列有更新到 127，因此两个大版本的模块 ABI 版本不同，按 NODE_MODULE_VERSION 匹配的原生模块二进制需要分别针对对应大版本准备。\\nD. 原生扩展兼容：若原生扩展仅使用 Node-API（node_api.h），官方文档说明可在一个大版本编译后在后续大版本上无需重新编译运行；若使用 node.h、uv.h 或 v8.h 等 API，则官方不提供跨大版本 ABI 稳定保证，扩展可能需要随大版本重新编译。\\nE. 22.0.0 的相关点：Windows 构建引入 C++20 支持（`build: compile with C++20 support on Windows`）。\\nF. 22.0.0 其他值得注意项：require() 加载 ESM 图、WebSocket 客户端、V8 更新；24.0.0：V8 13.6、npm 11、AsyncLocalStorage 默认 AsyncContextFrame、URLPattern 全局可用。\\nG. 结论/建议：升级到 24 时，Windows 上需准备 ClangCL 工具链；按 NODE_MODULE_VERSION=137 分发原生模块，Node-API 模块可沿用既有 ABI 稳定性，直接依赖 V8/Node C++ API 的模块需重编译。\\n\\nFor each claim A–G give: source number + exact phrase + verdict (supported / needs correction / 未在官方资料中确认). Flag any claim where the exact phrase does not literally support the scope (e.g., commit list vs final constant; compile Node.js vs compile addons).\"}",
